    <bpmn:process id="W_W275" name="W275. IFRS 16 / PFRS 16 Lease Accounting &amp; Modifications" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Execution of a new long-term store lease, or modification (renewal, rent escalation, space reduction) of an existing lease.
Frequency: Monthly
Volume: 5-10 modifications or new setups per month
Owner: Leases Accountant
Participants: Real Estate Team, Finance, Legal
Source: workflow W275 — IFRS 16 / PFRS 16 Lease Accounting &amp; Modifications</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W275_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W275_Lane1" name="Director, Facilities &amp; Real Estate">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W275_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W275_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W275_Lane2" name="Finance Controller">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W275_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W275_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W275_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W275_Lane3" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W275_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W275_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W275_End12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W275_Start5" name="Execution of a new long-term store lease, or modification (renewal, rent escalation…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W275_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W275_Task6" name="Real Estate finalizes the lease terms (W117) and routes executed contract to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Real Estate finalizes the lease terms (W117) and routes executed contract to Finance
Responsible (R): Director, Facilities &amp; Real Estate / Lease Admin
Accountable (A): Finance (Finance Controller (Lease Accounting))
Duration: 1 day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W275_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W275_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W275_Task7" name="Finance Controller (Lease Accounting) inputs the lease parameters (term…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Finance Controller (Lease Accounting) inputs the lease parameters (term, incremental borrowing rate, fixed/variable payments, payment schedule) into the ERP Lease Accounting module
Responsible (R): Finance Controller (Lease Accounting)
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: 30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W275_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W275_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W275_Task8" name="System calculates the initial Right-of-Use (ROU) Asset and Lease Liability…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: System calculates the initial Right-of-Use (ROU) Asset and Lease Liability using present-value method; Controller reviews the calculation for accuracy
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: 15 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W275_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W275_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W275_Task9" name="System posts the initial journal entry (Dr. ROU Asset / Cr. Lease Liability)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: System posts the initial journal entry (Dr. ROU Asset / Cr. Lease Liability); monthly auto-posts depreciation on ROU asset and interest expense on liability
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Finance Controller (Lease Accounting)
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W275_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W275_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W275_Task10" name="Upon a modification (e.g., rent escalation, space reduction, lease extension)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Upon a modification (e.g., rent escalation, space reduction, lease extension), Lease Admin notifies Finance; Controller triggers a reassessment in the ERP which recalculates the present value and adjusts the liability and ROU asset balances dynamically
Responsible (R): Finance Controller (Lease Accounting)
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: 30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W275_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W275_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W275_Task11" name="External auditor reviews a sample of lease accounting entries during annual…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: External auditor reviews a sample of lease accounting entries during annual audit (W95); Finance provides supporting documentation (lease contracts, discount rate methodology, modification history)
Responsible (R): Finance Controller (Lease Accounting)
Accountable (A): External Auditor
Duration: Per W95</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W275_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W275_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W275_End12" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W275_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W275_Annotation13">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-301 (ensure controlled execution — Site Selection &amp; Lease Management (PA-20.1).) | - operational: Finance (Finance Controller (Lease Accounting)) review and approval gate
Owner: Leases Accountant</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W275_Assoc14" sourceRef="W275_Annotation13" targetRef="W275_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W275_Flow15" sourceRef="W275_Start5" targetRef="W275_Task6" />
